gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Long ago, ten towns on a lonely island\n"
	.string "swore themselves to a single crown.\p"
	.string "The KINGDOM OF ALDMERE has been ruled\n"
	.string "by the HOUSE OF VALCOURT for three\l"
	.string "hundred years.\p"
	.string "When heirs quarrel, they do not raise\n"
	.string "armies. They battle. A TRIAL OF\l"
	.string "STANDING settles the matter.\p"
	.string "KING ALDRIC has ten children. Nine of\n"
	.string "them were born to the late queen.\p"
	.string "The tenth was not.\p"
	.string "Who are you?\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "Its people live alongside POKéMON.\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

@ Not shown once the features thread's intro changes land; kept for the
@ vanilla intro sequence.
gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "In ALDMERE, POKéMON and the law are\n"
	.string "bound together.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "Who are you?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you the king's son?\n"
	.string "Or the king's daughter?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "And what are you called?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}. Is that right?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "{PLAYER}. The youngest of the king's\n"
	.string "children.\p"
	.string "The one the court would rather forget.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Today, the court will finally decide\n"
	.string "what to do with you.\p"
	.string "They call it the APPORTIONMENT.\p"
	.string "$"
